: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">测试时间及地点</span></p><p class="docx_a3" style="text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">体育专项测试：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日（周</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">上午</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">09:00-10:00</span></p><p class="docx_a3" style="text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">游泳</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">项目在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">导航</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">运动中心（</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">西安市雁塔区光华路1号</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">测试，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">篮球</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">项目在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学北校区体育馆</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">测试</span></p><p class="docx_a3" style="text-indent: 32.15pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">综合素质面试：</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年3月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日（周</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">三</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">）</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">上午</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">:00-1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">:00</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">北校区会议中心</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">0</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">室</span></p><p class="docx-num-1-0" style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">测试流程及面试</span><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">成绩组成</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">我校将对符合资格考生的综合素质与体育专项能力进行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">测试</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">。其中，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">体育专项成绩</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">占</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">50</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">分，针对考生所报名体育招生项目能力进行测试。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-weight: bold; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">综合素质面试</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">占</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">50</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">分，针对考生的思想品德、语言表达及逻辑思维能力进行测评，内容包含：1.核验考生身份；2.自我介绍（不超过3分钟）；3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">回答专家提问</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">（约10分钟）。</span></p><p class="docx-num-1-0" style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 0pt;"><span style="font-family: 黑体; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">注意事项</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">1.考试当天，考生及随行人员凭出示身份证件进入学校</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">2.考</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">场区域封闭管理，请考生出示身份证原件进入考场，陪同人员请勿入内；</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">3</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">考生须在专项测试之前签订《保送优秀运动员考生反</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">兴奋剂承诺书》，拒不签订承诺书或拒绝接受兴奋剂检查的考生，视为主动放弃考试资格。</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; margin-right: 32pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">西安电子科技大学招生办公室</span></p><p style="min-height: 28pt; line-height: 28pt; text-indent: 32pt; margin-right: 80pt; text-align: right;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">202</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">5</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">年3月</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">7</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; min-height: 16pt; font-size: 16pt;">日</span></p></article></section>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div>
